{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your home from those evil cockroaches!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galaxy Critter Co.</strong> is a chaotic, dark-humored roguelike TD, inspired by beloved roguelike &amp; tower defense games like <i>Thronefall</i>, <i>Plants vs. Zombies</i>, and <i>Brotato</i>, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The rules are simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Build freely during the day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Fight off the swarm at night!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Defend your home for 8\u201315 days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Survive and defeat the Boss to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc31 The animals are seriously adorable \u2570(\u00b0\u25bd\u00b0)\u256f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc3b 9 heros and employees, 9 unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd27 Buildings, turrets, and weapons - mix and match freely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d 100+ passive items to craft your ultimate build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Demo is out and we\u2019d love your feedback!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Demo includes: 3 heros/employees, 35+ buildings &amp; weapons, and 90+ passive items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is proudly presented by <i>two rats</i>! We are now working on developing the full version and hopefully it will release 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re part-time indie devs, but will keep polishing the visuals, feel, and balance while adding contents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing, and we'd love your feedback and support &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6fa33670cad741553fd63197e4f7c84d.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6fa33670cad741553fd63197e4f7c84d.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6fa33670cad741553fd63197e4f7c84d.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630680?t=1773233228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/c241ef63585899bede3a22d0087662a4f0ab86c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773233228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/09dde60b23b3530217a5310edd8abd16b91a8ef1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773233228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/09dde60b23b3530217a5310edd8abd16b91a8ef1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773233228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4299880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your home from those evil cockroaches!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/3b9d7fe12a4cb271ab43665af2737d3f.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galaxy Critter Co.</strong> is a chaotic, dark-humored roguelike TD, inspired by beloved roguelike &amp; tower defense games like <i>Thronefall</i>, <i>Plants vs. Zombies</i>, and <i>Brotato</i>, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The rules are simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Build freely during the day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Fight off the swarm at night!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Defend your home for 8\u201315 days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Survive and defeat the Boss to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/38b32345aa5b1f982bd21c7908fa2170.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc31 The animals are seriously adorable \u2570(\u00b0\u25bd\u00b0)\u256f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc3b 9 heros and employees, 9 unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd27 Buildings, turrets, and weapons - mix and match freely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d 100+ passive items to craft your ultimate build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/6769dc25ee9ac128152ef350ab9e6a63.mp4?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Demo is out and we\u2019d love your feedback!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Demo includes: 3 heros/employees, 35+ buildings &amp; weapons, and 90+ passive items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.poster.avif?t=1773233228\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630680/extras/f4cd17ae20ff5296ce81a748790a12da.webm?t=1773233228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/